# OpenRouter ONLY, free (:free) models. One API key, one pool, four different model families.
# Roles:
# - PLAN   : nvidia nemotron-3-ultra-550b (largest free model available).
# - BUILD  : cohere north-mini-code (code-specialised).
# - REVIEW : google gemma-4-31b-it (different family than builder and planner).
# - TEST   : inclusionai ling-3.2-flash (fast and light for running/fixing tests).
# Notes:
# - All share ONE OpenRouter rate limit (requests/min and requests/day, higher if the account has credits).
#   If you hit it, everything stops: that is the trade-off of a single provider.
# - Free endpoints may log prompts or use them for training: avoid private code.
# - Alternatives (all :free): google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it, nvidia/nemotron-3.5-super-vl,
#   nvidia/nemotron-3.5-lightning, thinkingmachines/inkling-2-small, recursive/flint-v1.0.
# - Last resort router (picks any free model for you): openrouter/openrouter/free
PLAN_MODEL=openrouter/nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free
BUILD_MODEL=openrouter/cohere/north-mini-code:free
REVIEW_MODEL=openrouter/google/gemma-4-31b-it:free
TEST_MODEL=openrouter/inclusionai/ling-3.2-flash:free
